2213b139-b516-4737-992e-5e734252968f	4e8e8cf6-923c-4953-ab05-58defec7082e	innate-vs-acquired-immunity	Innate Vs Acquired Immunity	article	Innate vs Acquired immunity.\nImmune responses: Capacity of the body to resist pathogenic\nagents.\n\n![Innate Vs Acquired Immunity - Clinical Figure 1](/lessons/images/general-pathology-inflammation-anemia/innate-vs-acquired-immunity/figure_01_p1.png)\n*Innate Vs Acquired Immunity — Clinical Figure 1 (Page 1 Reference)*	\N	[]	\N	f	6	published	2026-10-14 23:52:49.070424+00	2026-11-02 05:50:26.18528+00	\N
