gh-Yield Clinical SBA Practice 4 - Clinical Figure 12](/lessons/images/sba/resuscitation-critical-care/high-yield-clinical-sba-practice-4/figure_12_p5.jpeg)\n*High-Yield Clinical SBA Practice 4 — Clinical Figure 12 (Page 5 Reference)*\n\n\n![High-Yield Clinical SBA Practice 4 - Clinical Figure 13](/lessons/images/sba/resuscitation-critical-care/high-yield-clinical-sba-practice-4/figure_13_p6.jpeg)\n*High-Yield Clinical SBA Practice 4 — Clinical Figure 13 (Page 6 Reference)*\n\n\n![High-Yield Clinical SBA Practice 4 - Clinical Figure 14](/lessons/images/sba/resuscitation-critical-care/high-yield-clinical-sba-practice-4/figure_14_p6.jpeg)\n*High-Yield Clinical SBA Practice 4 — Clinical Figure 14 (Page 6 Reference)*\n\n\n![High-Yield Clinical SBA Practice 4 - Clinical Figure 15](/lessons/images/sba/resuscitation-critical-care/high-yield-clinical-sba-practice-4/figure_15_p6.jpeg)\n*High-Yield Clinical SBA Practice 4 — Clinical Figure 15 (Page 6 Reference)*\n\n\n![High-Yield Clinical SBA Practice 4 - Clinical Figure 16](/lessons/images/sba/resuscitation-critical-care/high-yield-clinical-sba-practice-4/figure_16_p7.jpeg)\n*High-Yield Clinical SBA Practice 4 — Clinical Figure 16 (Page 7 Reference)*\n\n\n![High-Yield Clinical SBA Practice 4 - Clinical Figure 17](/lessons/images/sba/resuscitation-critical-care/high-yield-clinical-sba-practice-4/figure_17_p7.jpeg)\n*High-Yield Clinical SBA Practice 4 — Clinical Figure 17 (Page 7 Reference)*\n\n\n![High-Yield Clinical SBA Practice 4 - Clinical Figure 18](/lessons/images/sba/resuscitation-critical-care/high-yield-clinical-sba-practice-4/figure_18_p7.jpeg)\n*High-Yield Clinical SBA Practice 4 — Clinical Figure 18 (Page 7 Reference)*\n\n\n![High-Yield Clinical SBA Practice 4 - Clinical Figure 19](/lessons/images/sba/resuscitation-critical-care/high-yield-clinical-sba-practice-4/figure_19_p7.jpeg)\n*High-Yield Clinical SBA Practice 4 — Clinical Figure 19 (Page 7 Reference)*\n\n\n![High-Yield Clinical SBA Practice 4 - Clinical Figu